title: "CAS-YOLO: annotations, trained weights and code for small-object detection of cucumber growth stages"
abstract: "Four-stage cucumber growth-stage annotations, the exact train/validation/test file lists, the weights of CAS-YOLO and of the YOLOv8n baseline, and the code needed to reproduce the reported metrics."
